title: "Ariadne: A Contestable AI Design Partner for Early-Stage Urban Design"
abstract: "An open-source, contestable AI co-design environment for early-stage urban design integrating QGIS, Place Syntax Tool, Ladybug/Radiance, EnergyPlus, OpenFOAM, and LLM judgement skills under human decision authority."
